--[[
    FLEET EMPIRE - AUTO FARM  (v3)

    Features:
      1. Auto Claim Daily + Playtime
      2. Auto Collect Offline Report
      3. Auto Dispatch (NPC Drivers & Own Truck separated) - modes: $/mile, Payout, Shortest
      4. Auto Refuel
      5. Auto Repair (NPC Drivers / Own Truck separated)
           - breakdown on the road (own truck)  -> Roadside Repair
           - parked broken truck (NPC trucks)   -> component repair
           - optional "Fix all components"      -> Full Service
      6. Auto Withdraw bank -> cash always >= minimum (default $100,000)
      7. Auto Execute after rejoin / server hop (update) via queue_on_teleport
      8. Auto Update   : when the game asks for an update, presses "UPDATE NOW" (RequestUpdate)
      9. Auto Reconnect: on disconnect / server shutdown, rejoins automatically
     10. Anti AFK + stats panel

    AUTO EXECUTE - the script must be loadable again on the new server. Pick one:
      a) save this script to  <workspace>/FleetEmpire/fleet_empire.lua   (recommended), or
      b) set  getgenv().FleetEmpireURL = "https://.../fleet_empire.lua"  before executing, or
      c) put the script in your executor's autoexec folder (then a & b are not needed)

    Hotkey: RightShift = hide / show window
]]

